{"id":"n70846-1-10","stage":1,"title":"전화기 · 电话机","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70846-1-10-1","ko":"아까 집에 전화했는데 안 받던데.","zh":"刚才我给家里打电话，没人接啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚，刚才","explanation":"아까：刚，刚才","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65975","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전화했는데","meaning":"打电话，通话","explanation":"전화하다：打电话，通话；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"전화하다","audio":"/audio/aa1e3e09fae7e076a6a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70847","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받던데.","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚，刚才","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65975","definition":"前不久。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"aa1e3e09fae7e076","term":"전화하다","zh":"打电话，通话","audio":"/audio/aa1e3e09fae7e076a6a6.mp3","entryId":"70847","definition":"人们通过电话机交谈。","pronunciation":["전ː화하다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，接受","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到要求、申请、提问、攻击或信号等的作用，或指对这些做出反应。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/18a8735d642b3ac56c0e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70846-1-10-2","ko":"나 계속 집에 있었는데 전화기가 고장 났나 보다.","zh":"我一直都在家里，估计是电话坏了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었는데","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전화기가","meaning":"电话机","explanation":"전화기：电话机；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전화기","audio":"/audio/920d2edb729250383ea3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70846","senseId":"1","lemma":"전화기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고장","meaning":"故障","explanation":"고장：故障","readings":[{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18856","senseId":"1","lemma":"고장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났나","meaning":"发，闹","explanation":"나다：发，闹；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"20","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보다.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"920d2edb72925038","term":"전화기","zh":"电话机","audio":"/audio/920d2edb729250383ea3.mp3","entryId":"70846","definition":"把说话声变成电波或电流发送出去，使相隔很远的人也可以互相对话的机器。","pronunciation":["전ː화기"]},{"id":"a1a759c684921a8d","term":"고장","zh":"故障","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3","entryId":"18856","definition":"机器或装置等不能正常运行。","pronunciation":["고ː장"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发，闹","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身体上产生某种现象或生病。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9255c4430e5b1bf7a5f8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.985,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70846","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/